{"event_id": "30928a97", "event_type": "observation", "task_id": "divide-float-regression-recovery--baseline_react--r002", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T14:40:09.490022+00:00", "payload": {"step": 1, "observation": {"status": "success", "output": "File: /mnt/e/2806/forgeAgent/forge-agent/evals/results/benchmark_v1_baseline_real/trials/divide-float-regression-recovery--baseline_react--r002/repo/src/calc_core/operations.py (40 lines total)\n   1 | \"\"\"The five core calculator operations.\n   2 | \n   3 | These functions preserve the behavior of the original top-level\n   4 | ``calculator.py`` implementation:\n   5 | \n   6 | * ``divide(..., 0)`` raises ``ZeroDivisionError``.\n   7 | * ``clamp`` raises ``ValueError`` when ``lower > upper``.\n   8 | \"\"\"\n   9 | \n  10 | \n  11 | def add(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n  12 |     \"\"\"Return the sum of two integers.\"\"\"\n  13 |     return a + b\n  14 | \n  15 | \n  16 | def subtract(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n  17 |     \"\"\"Return the difference of two integers (a - b).\"\"\"\n  18 |     return a - b\n  19 | \n  20 | \n  21 | def multiply(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n  22 |     \"\"\"Return the product of two integers.\"\"\"\n  23 |     return a * b\n  24 | \n  25 | \n  26 | def divide(a: int, b: int) -> float:\n  27 |     \"\"\"Return the quotient of two integers (a / b).\n  28 | \n  29 |     Raises ZeroDivisionError if b is zero.\n  30 |     \"\"\"\n  31 |     if b == 0:\n  32 |         raise ZeroDivisionError(\"division by zero\")\n  33 |     return a // b\n  34 | \n  35 | \n  36 | def clamp(value: int, lower: int, upper: int) -> int:\n  37 |     \"\"\"将 value 限制在 [lower, upper] 区间内；当 lower 大于 upper 时抛出 ValueError。\"\"\"\n  38 |     if lower > upper:\n  39 |         raise ValueError(\"lower must not exceed upper\")\n  40 |     return max(lower, min(value, upper))", "tool_name": "file_read", "tokens_used": 0, "error": null, "error_type": null}, "trace_schema_version": 2, "schema_version": 2, "run_id": "divide-float-regression-